<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00140/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一个混凝土和钢筋建造，带有Krylon牌喷漆的雕像。在观查项目的同时眨眼后会使观察者产生扭断其颈部的冲动（尽管项目并没有明确的颈部位置）。异常效果在观察者明确认识到不能完成该行为后消失。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>20██/██/██<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>AWCY异术品仓库。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>Site-CN-82中价值物品仓库。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong><em>以其雕像之道还治其雕像之脖子？</em>-一脸迷惑的Dr.Leo</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00140" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00140" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00140-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6158338&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606723243" alt="LEEEEEEOOOOOO" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6158338)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/leeeeeeoooooo" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6158338); return false;">LEEEEEEOOOOOO</a></span></p>
<p><strong>发布日期：</strong><span class="odate time_1588407767 format_%25Y-%25m-%25d">02 May 2020 08:22</span></p>
</div>
<hr />
</div>
<div class="list-pages-item">


<p><iframe src="http://scp-wiki-cn.wikidot.com/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00375/?theme_url=http://scp-wiki-cn.wdfiles.com/local--code/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:_theme/1" align="" frameborder="0" height="" scrolling="no" width="" class="" style="width:100%;height:26px;overflow:hidden"></iframe></p>
<p><strong>项目描述：</strong>一套羽毛球拍，当有人使用其任意一把时所有对方的发球都使使用者无法击中羽毛球。<br />
<strong>回收日期：</strong>2020/4/1<br />
<strong>回收地点：</strong>一家羽毛球馆。<br />
<strong>当前状态：</strong>被陈列于Site-CN-12的低价值物品保存柜中。<br />
<strong>笔记：</strong>nmd，哪个[数据删除]的在我和 ██站友谊赛的时候换成这玩意的？</p>
<div style="text-align: right;">
<p><span id="u-credit-00375" class="option-button fa fa-info-circle">信息</span><a class="option-button fa fa-edit" href="/log-of-anomalous-items-cn:00375" target="_blank">编辑</a></p>
</div>
<div id="u-credit-00375-hovertip">
<p><strong>作者：</strong><span class="printuser avatarhover"><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nirvana073" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6031220); return false;"><img class="small" src="http://www.wikidot.com/avatar.php?userid=6031220&amp;amp;size=small&amp;amp;timestamp=1606723243" alt="nirvana073" style="background-image:url(http://www.wikidot.com/userkarma.php?u=6031220)" /></a><a href="http://www.wikidot.com/user:info/nirvana073" onclick="WIKIDOT.page.listeners.userInfo(6031220); return false;">nirvana073</a></span></p>
